What the license covers
-----------------------
All of Craft Compass's own code: Core/, Locales/, Sources/ and UI/.

Data from other addons
----------------------
Craft Compass ships no item, recipe or quest data of its own. While the game runs it reads them through the public
functions of two other addons the player installs separately; none of their code or data is copied into this one:

- AtlasLoot Classic (required): crafts, reagents and recipe items (AtlasLoot.Data.Profession, AtlasLoot.Data.Recipe).
- QuestieDB, part of Questie (optional): quests, NPCs, objects and where items come from (LibQuestieDB), and
  Questie's quest link text (QuestieLoader's QuestieLink).

Third-party components
----------------------
Libs/ contains libraries of the Ace3 project (https://www.wowace.com/projects/ace3): LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0,
AceGUI-3.0 and AceConfig-3.0, copyright the Ace3 Development Team and their authors, released under their own
BSD-style license, which allows them to be shipped with this program.

